# `SessionGhostValid`-Strengthened Block-518 / Block-520 `decryptPrekey` (`W4`) Poll Contracts

Establishes fixed-`cliRunBudgets`, Path-C-P3-parametric block-518 D2(c) poll contracts
both with and without `SessionGhostValid` (`W4r2PollCustomP3SeqFreeEnv` and
`W4r2PollCustomP3GvSeqFreeEnv`), discharging Path-C Over Stage P2 directly from
`InitialStateMemInvPlacedOkOfEnv` (`_of_init75`) under `LibsignalFrozen`.
-/

